{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b61b88012e86430f6baeed830036778f9b851208bae11ad271094bcfb1700507",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d60f8f7f92beb0f83d4118db9b219eb4a1657812bef9235bb2854f72c31fb5bc",
      "text": "打扰了。●●●●プロデューサー，\n能给我一点时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef20c144bc5be91cbaddad07e36b4fd9654dc6e33f0d8587161d736626791d0b",
      "text": "好的，完全没关系哦。\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b422511d907d8ded0924770a501bd2d4367c508e48a866cb39c791b351252f6",
      "text": "我来把这个交给你。\n作为情人节的谢礼，希望能收下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35bca1035413ebfdb8672d23789ca55937d44de6029c79a0ad1aac9a7011cd1c",
      "text": "吸取了去年白色情人节的反思经验，\n今年我很早就开始了调研。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa39b0a93e141578c2377fa4ad3b1adc747380f69ee5679a195950ed76eacb2",
      "text": "其结果就是，我有自信挑选出了\n能让你感到高兴的物品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:452442a44ffc8e65c9d85f67bfc80f5535909b99d565a45258851c5c32400423",
      "text": "今年的回礼是一支多功能保温随行杯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fae4240b2f036ab79c3062634a5e4e719d96e6b361ead39b59c27d01b191cc86",
      "text": "内部采用了多层结构设计，\n便于保持液体的温度……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b65a535856d02c68024f4d5dacad3029a9180061d3f5a5659875da3f053eec6",
      "text": "不。与其用语言说明，不如亲自使用\n更能切身体会吧。不嫌弃的话请尝试用用看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_035_23_5_02_035_23:5_02_035_23:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d122de8190522479733284563a7451d9f38141ccec3882e17ac4e0dcbcdd68c",
      "text": "我明白了。\n我马上就拿来用哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
